\d tbl_gist
              Table "public.tbl_gist"
 Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default 
--------+---------+-----------+----------+---------
 c1     | integer |           |          | 
 c2     | integer |           |          | 
 c3     | integer |           |          | 
 c4     | box     |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "tbl_gist_c4_c1_c2_c3_excl" EXCLUDE USING gist (c4 WITH &&) INCLUDE (c1, c2, c3)

